flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md S5, S9, H-03, Release 2, open questions; business-analysis.md FR-05/FR-08/NFR-04.

    start([Start: Draft revision needs review evidence])
    actor_tbd[Unverified / TBD: who owns eval contract and thresholds]
    evidence["[TBD Screen] Test Evidence"]
    inputs[Reusable Test Inputs]
    run[Run Comparison]
    run_ok{Evaluation completes?\nFailure behavior: Unverified / TBD}
    failed[Unverified / TBD: Evaluation Failed]
    results[Side-by-Side Outputs and Pass-Fail]
    cost[Cost and Token Comparison]
    regression{Regression or cost increase?}
    alert[Regression or Cost Alert]
    action{Revise or continue?}
    complete{Required evidence complete?}
    incomplete[Evidence Incomplete]
    ready[Review-Ready Evidence]
    review_ready_end([End: evidence ready for one-level review])
    end_revise([End: return to Manage Revisions flow])

    start --> actor_tbd
    actor_tbd -->|Open evidence workspace| evidence
    evidence -->|Add or reuse test inputs| inputs
    inputs -->|Run comparison| run
    run --> run_ok
    run_ok -->|No| failed
    failed -->|Retry| run
    failed -->|Return to Draft| incomplete
    run_ok -->|Yes| results
    results -->|Review quality evidence| cost
    cost --> regression
    regression -->|No| complete
    regression -->|Yes| alert
    alert --> action
    action -->|Revise Draft| incomplete
    action -->|Continue with visible warning| complete
    complete -->|No| incomplete
    incomplete -->|Add evidence| evidence
    incomplete -->|Revise prompt| end_revise
    complete -->|Yes| ready
    ready --> review_ready_end
